.TH ZTTY 1
.SH NAME
ztty \- terminal on GPUI and Ely
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ztty
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ztty is a graphical terminal for X11 and Wayland.
Projects and their worktrees sit on the left, the worktree's tabs in the middle, and Files, Git's changes or Git's commits on the right.
Open Settings with Ctrl-comma to change appearance, shell and terminal settings.
Settings lists the keyboard shortcuts available on the current platform.
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/Ztty/settings.json
.br
Settings are saved here, or in
.I ~/.config/Ztty/settings.json
when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is unset.
Installing, upgrading or removing a package does not remove this file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.UR https://github.com/zzqxvii/ztty
Ztty documentation and releases
.UE
